<!-- MTGA launcher glyph: a feather in relief. Rounded lobes pointing to the
     tip, parted by narrow slits, each lit like a cushion, over a gradient
     from a light base to a deep tip; a light from the upper left, a shade on
     the lower right; a shaft that tapers the whole way and sits in a faint
     groove, part of the feather rather than laid on it.
     The colours are the wallpaper's own palette, see res/values/colors.xml;
     the light and the shade are white and black at low opacity, so they work
     on any palette. The themed icon uses the flat silhouette,
     ic_launcher_monochrome. Scaled to stay inside the 66 dp safe zone. -->
